  "content": {
    "title": "Where is Texas Tech? More on Akron Zips' first-round March Madness game",
    "text": "March 20, 2026Updated March 21, 2026, 6:45 p.m. ETThe No. 12 Akron Zips will face the No. 5 Texas Tech Red Raiders in the first round of the NCAA Tournament.This is the Zips' third consecutive year in the tournament after winning the Mid-American Conference tournament.Texas Tech University is a public research school located in Lubbock, Texas.The game is scheduled for 12:40 p.m. ET today and will be broadcast on TruTV.The No. 12 Akron Zips men's basketball team tips off in the NCAA Division I Tournament today, facing No. 5 seed Texas Tech (22-10, 12-6 Big 12) in a Midwest Region first-round game.This is the Zips' eighth appearance in March Madness, and the third year in a row the team has claimed the Mid-American Conference championship to enter the NCAA Tournament.Here's what to know about the Zips' Midwest Region first-round game, including where Texas Tech is located and how to watch the game.Where is Texas Tech located?Texas Tech University is a public research institution in Lubbock, Texas. The school has a total enrollment of 42,272 students, compared to 15,318 at the University of Akron.The Red Raiders are members of the Big 12 Conference and enter the tournament with a 22-10 (12-6 Big 12) record. Akron comes into the tournament at 29-5 (17-1 in the MAC). Texas Tech head coach Grant McCasland was brought on board in 2023, and has a 51-20 overall record. John Groce became the Zips head coach in 2017 and has a 140-81 overall record through seven seasons.Where do the Akron Zips play the Texas Tech Red Raiders during the NCAA men's basketball tournament?The Zips will tip off against the Red Raiders at 12:40 p.m. ET today, March 20, at Benchmark International Arena in Tampa, Florida.The winner will face either No. 4 Alabama or No. 13 Hofstra in the second round on Sunday, March 22.How to watch the Akron Zips vs. Texas Tech Red Raiders today, March 20The game will be broadcast live on TruTV. You can also watch it through the March Madness Live app.",
